          </svg>
        </a>
        <ThemeToggle />
      </header>

      <p class="intro">
        <span>Rude Ayelo</span> leads teams building products at scale, aligning
        leadership, frontend architecture and UX to drive clarity, quality and
        momentum.
      </p>
      <p class="role">Engineering lead at <a href="https://g2.com">G2</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --background: #f4f5f5;
    --text: #001e33;
    --text-muted: #6b7377;
    --toggle-bg: hsl(205, 5%, 10%);
    --toggle-text: hsl(205, 5%, 45%);
    --toggle-text-hover: hsl(205, 5%, 90%);
    --focus: hsl(205, 90%, 45%);
  }

  :root[data-theme="dark"] {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --background: #111213;
    --text: #e4e6e7;
    --text-muted: #858d91;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    min-height: 100%;
    background: var(--background);
  }

  body {
    min-height: 100dvh;
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--background);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: "Lilex", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
  }

  .shell {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100vw - 32px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 56px) 0;
  }

  .site-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .site-logo {
    display: block;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .site-logo svg {
    display: block;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
  }

  .theme-toggle {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: var(--toggle-bg);
    color: var(--toggle-text);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .theme-toggle:hover {
    color: var(--toggle-text-hover);
  }

  .theme-toggle:focus {
    outline: none;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--focus);
  }

  .theme-toggle svg {
    display: block;
  }

  .visually-hidden {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 45ch;
    margin: 100px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2.54vw, 2.565rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .intro span {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .role {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .role a {
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration-thickness: 0.08em;
    text-underline-offset: 0.14em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .shell {
      width: min(100% - 24px, 420px);
      padding-top: 18px;
    }

    .intro {
      margin-top: 100px;
      font-size: clamp(1.0125rem, 4.95vw, 1.44rem);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *,
    *::before,
    *::after {
      scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
      animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
      animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    }
  }
</style>
